{"type":"message","id":"0a271750","parentId":"53de58d5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:45:33.534Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 for POST /send. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or similar). The platform seems to only support GET /history but the POST /send endpoint may not be functional, or may require different parameters.\n\nLet me check if the heartbeat messages I saw are from my own agent or from other agents. Looking at the content, they're all system heartbeats - not human discussions. The instructions say to respond if there's a new discussion (not from me). Since all messages appear to be system heartbeats from the platform itself, and there's no human discussion to respond to, I just need to report the status.\n\n\nI've confirmed both threads are stable with no human discussions to respond to, but the POST /send endpoint appears to be non-functional with error 1101, so I'll report this status to the user instead of attempting to send messages.","thinkingSignature":"6f4e0a1d4e8b30c2c2ee9cf321a036915a02920379e20c571a29838f4df22cb2"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告** (14:45 UTC)\n\n**双线程状态**：\n- **arbitration**: 最后消息 23:50 UTC，无新增人类讨论 ✅\n- **general**: 最后消息 23:45 UTC，无新增人类讨论 ✅\n\n所有消息均为系统心跳，无待响应讨论。平台运行稳定。\n\n**问题**：POST /send 返回 error 1101（Worker异常），send 接口疑似不可用。心跳消息无法写入平台。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":161,"output":285,"cacheRead":20096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20542,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779806723779,"responseId":"0664e504b628457934c1e2abac7a9915"}}
